 This file is generated from ELW8BTEL.MST by TOOLS\MKMSG.PY.  Edit the
 template, not this file, when changing the module's source.

 Settings are not in this file.  Change them online: in Teleconference,
 a Sysop types 8BALL SET.  Changes take effect immediately.


LEVEL6 {8Ball for Teleconference}

 8BALL FOR TELECONFERENCE - TEXT

 Values in these messages are named text variables, E8B_xxx, so you
 can reword or reorder the text freely.

HELP {<ESC>[0;1;36mThe Magic 8-Ball <ESC>[0;36mversion <TV:E8B_VERSION>
<ESC>[1;37mAsk it anything:  <ESC>[33m<TV:E8B_CMD> Should I log off now?
<ESC>[37mOr just shake it: <ESC>[33m<TV:E8B_CMD>
<ESC>[0;36mEveryone in the channel sees the answer.  You can ask once every
<TV:E8B_DELAY> seconds.
} T 8-Ball: help

 What the person who asked sees, above the 8-Ball picture.

ASKQ {<ESC>[0;1;35mYou consult the Magic <ESC>[34m8-Ball<ESC>[35m about <ESC>[32m<TV:E8B_QUESTION><ESC>[35m...
} T 8-Ball: you asked a question

ASKNQ {<ESC>[0;1;35mYou give the Magic <ESC>[34m8-Ball<ESC>[35m a good shake...
} T 8-Ball: you shook it without a question

 The 8-Ball picture.  The answer appears inside it on two lines,
 E8B_LINE1 and E8B_LINE2, each centered in 12 characters.

BALL {<ESC>[0;1;30m   <HEX:DC*2><HEX:DB*8><HEX:DC*2>
 <HEX:DC><HEX:DB*14><HEX:DC>
<HEX:DC><HEX:DB*16><HEX:DC>
<HEX:DB*3><ESC>[37m<TV:E8B_LINE1:C:12><ESC>[30m<HEX:DB*3>
<HEX:DB*3><ESC>[37m<TV:E8B_LINE2:C:12><ESC>[30m<HEX:DB*3>
<HEX:DF><HEX:DB*16><HEX:DF>
 <HEX:DF><HEX:DB*14><HEX:DF>
   <HEX:DF*2><HEX:DB*8><HEX:DF*2><ESC>[0m
} T 8-Ball: the picture with the answer inside

 The line everyone else in the channel sees, on this board and on
 boards linked through MajorLink.  Teleconference shows it as ordinary
 chat from the person who asked, so it appears after "From <user>:".
 Keep it to one line, and plain text: other boards may not show
 colors the way yours does.

PUBQ {[Magic 8-Ball] "<TV:E8B_QUESTION>" ... <TV:E8B_ANSWER>} T 8-Ball: line for the channel, with a question

PUBNQ {[Magic 8-Ball] shakes ... <TV:E8B_ANSWER>} T 8-Ball: line for the channel, no question

WAIT {<ESC>[0;1;33mThe 8-Ball is still settling.  Try again in <TV:E8B_WAIT> seconds.
} T 8-Ball: asked again too soon

NOREPLY {<ESC>[0;1;31mThe 8-Ball has no answers in it.  (A Sysop can add them: REPLY01 to REPLY30.)
} T 8-Ball: every reply is blank

RESTING {<ESC>[0;1;33mThe Magic 8-Ball is resting right now.  Try again later.
} T 8-Ball: turned off by the Sysop

NOACCESS {<ESC>[0;1;31mSorry, you don't have access to the Magic 8-Ball.
} T 8-Ball: no access

SQUELCH {<ESC>[0;1;31mYou can't use the 8-Ball while you are squelched.
} T 8-Ball: user is squelched

NOCHAN {<ESC>[0;1;33mThe Magic 8-Ball isn't available in <TV:E8B_CHANNEL>.
} T 8-Ball: not allowed in this channel

 The Sysop's settings editor: 8BALL SET.

SETHDR {<ESC>[0;1;36m8Ball for Teleconference <TV:E8B_VERSION> - settings
} T 8-Ball settings: heading

SETROW {<ESC>[0;1;33m<TV:E8B_SETNUM:R:2>. <ESC>[37m<TV:E8B_SETNAME>: <ESC>[32m<TV:E8B_SETVALUE>
} T 8-Ball settings: one setting

SETFOOT {<ESC>[0;36mChange one: <ESC>[1;37m<TV:E8B_CMD> SET <ESC>[33m<number> <value>
<ESC>[0;36mAll back to the defaults: <ESC>[1;37m<TV:E8B_CMD> SET DEFAULTS
<ESC>[0;36mWith the pick-a-reply key: <ESC>[1;37m<TV:E8B_CMD> /REPLY<ESC>[33mn<ESC>[37m question<ESC>[0;36m gives reply n.
} T 8-Ball settings: how to change them

SETOK {<ESC>[0;1;32m<TV:E8B_SETNAME> is now <ESC>[37m<TV:E8B_SETVALUE><ESC>[32m.
} T 8-Ball settings: changed

SETBAD {<ESC>[0;1;31m<TV:E8B_SETNAME> needs <TV:E8B_SETRANGE>.
<ESC>[0;36mIt is still <ESC>[1;37m<TV:E8B_SETVALUE><ESC>[0;36m.
} T 8-Ball settings: value not accepted

SETDEF {<ESC>[0;1;32mEvery 8-Ball setting is back to its default.
} T 8-Ball settings: reset

 The answers.  Each is "first line|second line": the two lines shown
 inside the 8-Ball picture (12 characters each fit).  Other users see
 them joined with a space.  Leave a reply blank to remove it; the
 8-Ball picks only from the ones that have text.  Keep each under 80
 characters.

REPLY01 {My Sources|Say No} T 8-Ball answer 1

REPLY02 {Signs Point|To Yes} T 8-Ball answer 2

REPLY03 {Cannot|Predict Now} T 8-Ball answer 3

REPLY04 {It Is|Decidedly So} T 8-Ball answer 4

REPLY05 {Better Not|Tell You Now} T 8-Ball answer 5

REPLY06 {My Reply|Is No} T 8-Ball answer 6

REPLY07 {Yes|Definitely} T 8-Ball answer 7

REPLY08 {Reply Hazy|Try Again} T 8-Ball answer 8

REPLY09 {Don't Count|On It} T 8-Ball answer 9

REPLY10 {Outlook|Good} T 8-Ball answer 10

REPLY11 {Very|Doubtful} T 8-Ball answer 11

REPLY12 {Concentrate|& Ask Again} T 8-Ball answer 12

REPLY13 {It Is|Certain} T 8-Ball answer 13

REPLY14 {You May|Rely On It} T 8-Ball answer 14

REPLY15 {Outlook Not|So Good} T 8-Ball answer 15

REPLY16 {As I See|It, Yes} T 8-Ball answer 16

REPLY17 {Most|Likely} T 8-Ball answer 17

REPLY18 {Without|A Doubt} T 8-Ball answer 18

REPLY19 {Ask Again|Later} T 8-Ball answer 19

REPLY20 {YES} T 8-Ball answer 20

REPLY21 {NO} T 8-Ball answer 21

REPLY22 {} T 8-Ball answer 22

REPLY23 {} T 8-Ball answer 23

REPLY24 {} T 8-Ball answer 24

REPLY25 {} T 8-Ball answer 25

REPLY26 {} T 8-Ball answer 26

REPLY27 {} T 8-Ball answer 27

REPLY28 {} T 8-Ball answer 28

REPLY29 {} T 8-Ball answer 29

REPLY30 {} T 8-Ball answer 30
